# Local pipeline data directory.
#
# DATA-PROTECTION POLICY: this public repository does NOT host third-party
# statistical registers or any data downloaded from them. Everything under
# eqasim-data/ is ignored by default; a contributor must download each input
# from its official source per README.md / DOWNLOAD_CHECKLIST_BS.md and place
# it locally. The ONLY data files that are deliberately force-added (committed)
# are the small, derived MiD 2023 aggregate reference tables
# (eqasim-data/data/braunschweig/mid/mid2023_*.csv), the small, derived SrV
# 2023 Braunschweig+RGB aggregate reference tables
# (eqasim-data/data/braunschweig/srv/srv2023_*.csv -- NOT srv2023_raw/, which
# is the local-only scientific-use microdata), the small LSN income-tax
# per-Kreis aggregate (eqasim-data/data/braunschweig/lsn/lsn2022_*.csv -- NOT
# lsn/raw/, which stays local), the blended control-target tables
# (eqasim-data/data/braunschweig/targets/target2026_*.csv, derived purely
# from the committed aggregates above), and the project's own
# calibration-evaluation outputs (.../mid/education_calibration/*), plus the
# documentation markdown. Do NOT `git add -f` any other data file here
# (Mikrozensus tables, NDS school/Hochschule/Kita facility tables, ALKIS/ATKIS,
# OSM, GTFS, population/employment registers, ...) -- they stay local only.
eqasim-data/*
!eqasim-data/.gitkeep
!eqasim-data/DOWNLOAD_CHECKLIST.md
!eqasim-data/DOWNLOAD_CHECKLIST_BS.md

# --- Internal working artefacts (kept out of the public research repository) ---
# Public-interface markdown is tracked normally -- README.md, CLAUDE.md,
# AGENTS.md, CHANGELOG.md, CITATION.cff, docs/*.md, braunschweig/*.md and the
# DOWNLOAD_CHECKLIST files. We deliberately do NOT ignore *.md globally, so the
# repository reads like a standard research-software project.
# The folders below hold ephemeral planning / AI-tooling / internal-QA content
# that does not belong in a citable scientific repository.
plan/
docs/superpowers/
docs/codebase/.codebase-scan.txt
quality/
.github/skills/
/memories/
SESSION_LOG.md
.claude/

# One-time school geocoder caches (not pipeline inputs, machine-local only).
eqasim-data/data/braunschweig/schools/geocode_cache*.json

# Claude Code plugin lock file (machine-local, not project code)
skills-lock.json
.superpowers/
